<description>&lt;p&gt;Israeli forces fired across the border into southern Syria, killing a Syrian man with disabilities in the Daraa buffer zone. Syrian security officers were killed during a raid on an ISIL cell near Damascus, and a separate counter-terror operation against an ISIS cell in Rankous resulted in the deaths of two Syrian security personnel. These incidents show simultaneous Israeli cross-border strikes and Syrian government actions against ISIS remnants. The conflict caused 2,732 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSEFVX3lxTFByX3hUSmJucGdmRFU0SlB0QVMxRElTeVotWVJKTGNUcEMwbHZHMzZobklOTTdBVGtiT2s1Z1BCOUtRRDJpbEFEMg?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/10/22/two-syrian-security-officers-killed-in-raid-on-isil-cell-near-damascus&quot;&gt;aljazeera.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.aljazeera.com/news-analysis/2026/10/22/ilhan-omar-home-raid-haines-attack-inside-rise-in-violence-on-officials&quot;&gt;aljazeera.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivwFBVV95cUxPREFDTmNYTXJhX2tQdV93OXZRbmoyRnJGVkF0VEtzRXlkNUNDYk15cGpFNHd0YXBqUXA2VGhfdkdKSXRRdHVXb0dUaXR6R3hUY05qWjJhbFUyMzBMYU43dU9GUkhmYl9YbmM3YjRzQmJGTzJPMWo0VXJHV2R6cG1xMXNmSjluM2ViX2lxWGtxYUtRWm9oa19BT2R0WHMzMlMtNU0zUVcxTjZidGFDbWg3d1pQdWI1clRwMFYzVTQyZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiX0FVX3lxTFBRMkN2WnJjUmhLMmNYOUo0NHdNTXJTMWZwaDBtdzQyQ245SGZlQ2RTcFU1bF9fdmZwM1N2ZEZzcVVvWGY1RERZcGRaMDgwVjVFa2RZQUF2RlI4dXUtSjdJ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Rudaw&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijwFBVV95cUxQZkdZS3h4YjlQZnJmVU1tWlhscFA3MHhyZzlvcmxwellWT2VsWVp